June 2021, I was visiting a park around Wenatchee, WA. I woke up early and spent the daybreak by the water, writing.

I was 21, aimless. 2-3 months after writing *Luna*, I found my first serious relationship and returned to education. A complete 180.

The poem helped me understand my (first) severe disability -- my hearing loss.

